nodes.desc:
Returns a paginated list of all registered users.
Delegates to UserService.getUser for individual lookups;
the list endpoint iterates the repository directly.


get /rest/userservice/v1/users


HTTP/1.1 200 OK
[
  {
    "id": "user_123",
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "displayName": "Alice",
    "status": "active"
  }
]
